<title>USA: CCC buys 1,750 tonnes of wheat for Honduras.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 1,750 tonnes of wheat for Honduras.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Agriculture Department said it bought 1,750 tonnes of northern spring/dark northern spring wheat for donation to Honduras.</p>
<p>It bought the wheat from Continental Grain Co at $165.33 per tonne, FOB. Shipment is for July 10 to August 5.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
